 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "Hi Kevin, I can't file this one for Alex. Under POL-ACC-01, access requests can only be filed by the employee themselves or by their manager for a direct report. Nobody else can file on someone's behalf, even with the employee's agreement.\n\nI'm assuming you mean Alex Moreno (Dispatch Coordinator, E020). His manager on record is Kofi Mensah (E005). There are two ways to get the request filed:\n- Alex can message the helpdesk himself and ask for BI access. BI is a standard system, so his manager approves it, usually within 1 business day.\n- Kofi Mensah can file it for him as his manager.\n\nIf I've got the wrong Alex, let me know his employee ID and I'll check.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
}
